# Agent Work Closeout

Before a Codex/Cursor agent commits, pushes, or hands off work in this repo, it must run:

```powershell
$env:PYTHONIOENCODING = "utf-8"
py codex_compat.py submit-closeout `
  --note "summary of shipped vs skipped work" `
  --file path/to/changed_file.py `
  --completed-fix "what was fixed this session" `
  --deferred-bug "title|file|reason_not_fixed" `
  --unsaid-flag "risk or follow-up not in the diff"
```

Then check:

```powershell
py codex_compat.py bug-notice-stats
```

Closeout data is local operator/runtime state and must remain ignored by git.
